===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[blue]] [[tit]]}}

# {{taxlink|Cyanistes caeruleus|species}}, a small bird of the [[tit]] family [[Paridae]], with an azure blue crown and dark blue line passing through the eye and encircling the white cheeks to the chin.

